usage: cli.py [-h]
              {validate,prepare,audit,dry-run,baseline,tokenizer-check,grammar-check,local-inputs-check,run}
              ...

CPU preparation CLI; run is deliberately closed until a separate GPU stage.

positional arguments:
  {validate,prepare,audit,dry-run,baseline,tokenizer-check,grammar-check,local-inputs-check,run}
    validate            verify original bytes and P2 registration, CPU only
    prepare             reconstruct historical evidence into a new external
                        directory
    audit               recompute and compare frozen checkpoint/diagnostic
                        data
    dry-run             write the conditional future request plan; no model
                        calls
    baseline            restore the original closed view and run its unchanged
                        checks
    tokenizer-check     optional installed CPU dependencies and local
                        tokenizer only
    grammar-check       optional installed CPU dependencies and local
                        tokenizer only
    local-inputs-check  hash registered local files without loading a model
    run                 REFUSED in this CPU stage; --dry-run only

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
